      },
      "text": "EARLY RENAISSANCE (Florence, 1400–1500)\n  Brunelleschi (1377–1446)\n    — Florence Cathedral dome (structural problem)\n    — Mathematical perspective (visual representation)\n    — Ospedale degli Innocenti (rational arcade)\n  Alberti (1404–1472)\n    — De Re Aedificatoria (architectural theory treatise)\n    — Santa Maria Novella facade (triumphal arch overlay on Gothic church)"
    },
    {
