      "text": "HIGH RENAISSANCE (Rome, 1500–1527)\n  Bramante (1444–1514)\n    — Tempietto (1502, first fully Classical Renaissance building)\n    — St. Peter's original plan (Greek cross, centralized dome)\n  Michelangelo (1475–1564)\n    — St. Peter's dome redesign (double shell, compressed)"
    },
