      "text": "BAROQUE (Rome + Europe, 1600–1750)\n  Bernini (1598–1680) — St. Peter's colonnade, Baldachin\n  Borromini (1599–1667) — S. Carlo alle Quattro Fontane, S. Ivo\n  Wren (1632–1723)  — St. Paul's Cathedral (triple dome)\n  Fischer von Erlach — Karlskirche Vienna\n  Guarini (1624–1683) — complex intersecting arches, Turin\n  Le Vau + Le Nôtre — Versailles\n  Guarini, de Cotte, Hardouin-Mansart — French variants\n```"
